    "detailed_description": "<strong>CookingPix</strong> is an online cooking card game for 1-5 players.<br>You can enjoy simple yet deep strategy building and bargaining.<br>You can play many times in a short time, so even people who don't have time can enjoy it easily!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple rules and deep strategy</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436230/extras/bc02a056c5342d1d2c5dd4692f8f0c51.avif?t=1690184842\" /></span><br><br>Mouse clicks only! Anyone can play.<br><br>The game ends when one player gets 3 cooking cards,<br>At that time, &quot;&quot;the player who collected \u2606 wins&quot;&quot;<br><br>1. Players get food cards and cooking cards in order.<br>2. Cooking Cards can be earned when the ingredients are met.<br>3. The game ends when one player gets 3 cooking cards.<br>4. The winner is the player with the most \u2606 dishes!<br>4.5 If you have coins on the cooking card, you will get coins every time it is your turn.<br>Coins can replace ingredients!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > What lies beyond victory?</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436230/extras/328c0f4e6a1e4b1e014c4afae95bac9b.avif?t=1690184842\" /></span><br><br>If you win the game, you can get the opponent's &quot;&quot;Mug Cup&quot;&quot;.<br>To get your favorite color, you need to think of a more reliable strategy!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Enjoy alone or with others!</h2><br>You can play with NPCs even if you are alone. Great for building strategies.<br><br>Even people who do not usually play games can play immediately.<br>Enjoy <strong>CookingPix</strong> with your family and friends!",
